Abstract = {The quality of rural human settlement environment is directly related to
   the quality of urban human settlements, which is a big problem in the
   development of China's social economy. In the special period of social
   transformation and the key stage of building a well-off society
   comprehensively, it is of great practical significance to pay attention
   to the optimization of rural human settlement environment. China is in
   the transition from traditional rural landscape to modern rural
   landscape. However, how to realize the smooth transformation and the
   sustainable development of rural landscape is urgent and tough issues.},
