Abstract = {Recent literatures empirically proved that spatial arrangements,
   interior ambient environment and architectural legibility are features
   reflecting corporate distinctiveness. This study endeavors to examine
   the linkage between corporate strategic orientation and its
   environmental design as corporate identity, focusing on visual and
   spatial design features. The objectives of the research are to study
   factors determining the design which conveys the corporate strategies,
   to investigates clients' perceptions vis-a-vis the existing corporate
