Abstract = {Case study of Fujian province is used to illustrate the problems of
   undeveloped economic, the urban and rural disparities, economic
   development clash with resources and environment, less capacity of
   independent innovation in the mountain regions of China from the view of
   the sustainable development. There are a lot of difficulties in solving
   these problems. Based on the regional condition, the ways to promote the
   sustainable development are analyzed from four principal points,
   including prospering mountainous areas, shorten the urban and rural
   disparities enhancing the performance of resources and environment and
   promoting the supporting capacity of independent innovation. These ways
   will promote the sustainable development of the economy in the mountain
