Abstract = {A school-based store-and-forward telemedicine program, which is
   delivered to school children by school staff is an acceptable model of
   care for treating skin infections. This indicates that non-clinicians
   have potential to play a key role in telemedicine. Benefits include
   empowerment and role redefinition of staff and potential improvements in
   health awareness of children, with no major issues perceived in the
   current program.},
