   PEOPLES R CHINA, JUN 15-17, 2009},
Organization = {Int Soc Study Behav Dev; SE Univ, Key Lab Child Dev \& Learning Sci;
   Minist Educ},
Abstract = {A hybrid Wireless Sensor Network System designed for education
   assessment is presented. The system can measure movement and biological
   electrical signal related to student's attention and emotional state in
   classroom. The bioelectrical signal is digitalized at 200Hz sample rate
   and transmitted wirelessly using ZigBee protocol. The hardware and
   software design of the system are given in the paper. By collecting
   movement and ECG data of teacher and student in classroom, we may
   measure mental reactions during learning in the classroom, model
   behavior interaction between them during learning process. It may be
   usefully in identifying hyperactivity of students who may need special
   teaching method.},
