Abstract = {With the Chinese urbanization process speeding up, the contradiction of
   the urban population growth and the housing shortage is increasing, and
   then with living environment destroying,the people's life and the urban
   construction had a profound impact. In the era of ``great
   transformation{''}, we be badly in need of a lot of researches and
   summaries for the problems of the residential planning and design
   according to the practical problems and the actual situation of human
   settlement environment research existing in China. This article attempts
   to make the evergrande mingdu community in taiyuan of actual
   investigation as an example to do some summaris and think about the
   local human settlement environment planning and design problems.},
